    "Use includeDefaultRules:false for the rebuilt profiles and end each normal combat profile with an unconditional move_towards_opponent fallback.",
    "Every SINGLE enemy-targeted specific-jutsu rule uses the shared registry gate range+1. SELF rules have no distance condition. ALL-method Core Rupture has no distance condition.",
    "Do not delete any legacy jutsu during the retheme. They become retirement candidates for a later dependency audit.",
    "The two hazard props share one new shared-pool signature, Core Rupture."
